OL,3,GNEWSA#10m roundabout upgrade plans
OL,4,Asubmitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted to upgrade
OL,7,Fone of Lincoln's busiest road junctions
OL,8,Fin a bid to cut congestion and improve
OL,9,Fsafety.
OL,11,FThe scheme for the A46 Nettleham
OL,12,Froundabout includes additional lanes
OL,13,Fand a 98ft (30m) pedestrian and cycle
OL,14,Fbridge linking the city with Nettleham,
OL,15,FLincolnshire County Council said.
OL,17,FThe improvements, previously estimated
OL,18,Fto cost about #10m, are designed to
OL,19,Fease traffic flows and make the
OL,20,Fjunction safer for motorists,
OL,21,Fpedestrians and cyclists.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
